<title>UK: Romanian BCR sets $75 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Romanian BCR sets $75 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCA COMERCIALA ROMANA SA (BCR)</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY    10.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+300 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BA3/BB-   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
